{"unit_id":"hawkongz__dsh-task-reminder#card-zh","repo":"hawkongz/dsh-task-reminder","commit":"02de37d1b1307f16c68410dc761d027b2c871b09","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Task Reminder（DSH 插件，Web 与桌面端）：在对话任务停止时提醒你查看结果。它在客户端观察会话运行状态、待处理交互和错误事件，并在宿主侧提供桌面窗口唤起与更新路由。主要功能包括完成、错误和等待用户处理时发送系统通知，播放合成或自选提示音，点击通知返回对应会话，以及在设置页检查更新。适合需要切换窗口处理其他事情、又想及时知道 DSH 会话何时结束或等待回应的用户。使用前需要允许浏览器通知；自选音频保存在本地，手动检查更新会查询 npm registry。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3955-4013","client.js:4255-4305","index.js:1281-1328"]}
{"unit_id":"hawkongz__dsh-task-reminder#card-en","repo":"hawkongz/dsh-task-reminder","commit":"02de37d1b1307f16c68410dc761d027b2c871b09","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Task Reminder alerts Web and Desktop users when conversations stop. It detects completion, errors, and requests for input, sends system notifications, and plays chimes. Clicking an alert reopens the session. Custom audio stays local; update checks query npm registries.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3955-4013","client.js:4255-4305","index.js:1281-1328"]}
