{"unit_id":"hawkongz__dsh-task-reminder#feature-1","repo":"hawkongz/dsh-task-reminder","commit":"02de37d1b1307f16c68410dc761d027b2c871b09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Task Reminder 的功能「任务停止通知」：检测会话完成、出错或出现待处理交互时，显示对应系统通知；相同停止信号会去重，错误优先。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3955-4013"]}
